\section{System Design of \mysys}
\label{sec:design}

\input{figures/sys-design/mysys-workflow}

\autoref{fig:overall_workflow} illustrates the workflow of \mysys.
The framework takes the traced Graph IR containing operator invocation information with \initialconsts as input, and proceeds through four stages: \textbf{Context Generation} (\S\ref{sec:design:context_construction}), \textbf{Early-Exit Identification} (\S\ref{sec:design:early-return}), \textbf{Constant Propagation} (\S\ref{sec:design:propagation}), and \textbf{Kernel Specialization} (\S\ref{sec:design:specialization}).
We detail each stage in the following subsections.

